              "text": "بند آمدن (band âmadan) — \"to stop (of rain, a flow)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بعد از یک ساعت باران بند آمد. Ba'd az yek sâ'at bârân band âmad. After an hour the rain stopped."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "band 'tie, block' + âmadan. Also of bleeding or of a voice."
            }
          ]
        },
