          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "band âmadan is built from native band 'a tie, a block', from the root of bastan (PIE bʰendʰ-, EtymDB), and âmadan 'to come', from PIE gʷem- (EtymDB)."
